{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2022-11-28 08:00:00', 'title': 'VIASAT-3 SATELLITE COMPLETES FINAL INTEGRATED SATELLITE TEST', 'text': 'CARLSBAD., CALIF. , NOV. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- VIASAT INC. (NASDAQ: VSAT), A GLOBAL LEADER IN SATELLITE COMMUNICATIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE VIASAT-3 AMERICAS SATELLITE HAS COMPLETED ITS FINAL INTEGRATED SATELLITE TEST (FIST) AND HAS NOW PROGRESSED TO THE FLIGHT FINAL PHASE OF INTEGRATION WHERE IT IS UNDERGOING FINAL BUILD-UP TO ITS FLIGHT CONFIGURATION.'}